				\begin{document}$${\text{Cell}}\;{\text{viability}}\;\left( \% \right) = \left( {{\text{N}}_{{\text{t}}} /{\text{N}}_{{\text{c}}} } \right) \times 100$$\end{document}Cellviability%=Nt/Nc×100where, Nt and Nc are the mean absorbance of treated and untreated cells respectively.
